msgid "# Batch Invariance"
msgstr "# 批次不变性"

msgid ""
"This document shows how to enable batch invariance in vLLM-Ascend. Batch "
"invariance ensures that the output of a model is deterministic and "
"independent of the batch size or the order of requests in a batch."
msgstr "本文档介绍如何在 vLLM-Ascend 中启用批次不变性。批次不变性确保模型的输出是确定性的，并且与批次大小或批次中请求的顺序无关。"

msgid "## Motivation"
msgstr "## 动机"

msgid "Batch invariance is crucial for several use cases:"
msgstr "批次不变性在以下几种使用场景中至关重要："

msgid ""
"- **Framework debugging**: Deterministic outputs make it easier to debug issues in the inference framework, as the same input will always produce the same output regardless of batching.\n"
"- **Model debugging**: Helps identify issues in model implementations by ensuring consistent behavior across different batch configurations.\n"
"- **Reinforcement Learning (RL)**: RL training often requires deterministic rollouts for reproducibility and stable training.\n"
"- **Large-scale inference systems**: Systems that use vLLM as a component benefit from deterministic behavior for testing, validation, and consistency guarantees."
msgstr ""
"- **框架调试**：确定性输出使得推理框架中的问题调试更加容易，因为无论批处理如何，相同的输入总是产生相同的输出。\n"
"- **模型调试**：通过确保不同批次配置下行为一致，帮助识别模型实现中的问题。\n"
"- **强化学习 (RL)**：RL 训练通常需要确定性的推演以实现可复现性和稳定训练。\n"
"- **大规模推理系统**：将 vLLM 作为组件的系统受益于确定性行为，用于测试、验证和一致性保证。"

msgid "## Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "## 硬件要求"

msgid ""
"Batch invariance currently requires Ascend Atlas A2 and A3 inference products NPUs.\n"
"We will support Ascend 950 Products and other NPUs in the future."
msgstr ""
"批次不变性目前需要 Ascend Atlas A2 和 A3 推理产品的 NPU。\n"
"我们将在未来支持 Ascend 950 产品及其他 NPU。"

msgid "## Software Requirements"
msgstr "## 软件要求"

msgid "## Enabling Batch Invariance"
msgstr "## 启用批次不变性"

msgid ""
"Batch invariance can be enabled by setting the `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT` "
"environment variable to `1`:"
msgstr "可以通过将 `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT` 环境变量设置为 `1` 来启用批次不变性："

msgid "### Online Inference (Server Mode)"
msgstr "### 在线推理（服务器模式）"

msgid "To start a vLLM server with batch invariance enabled:"
msgstr "启动启用了批次不变性的 vLLM 服务器："

msgid "Then use the OpenAI-compatible client:"
msgstr "然后使用 OpenAI 兼容的客户端："

msgid "### Offline Inference"
msgstr "### 离线推理"

msgid "For offline batch inference with batch invariance:"
msgstr "对于具有批次不变性的离线批次推理："

msgid "## Tested Models"
msgstr "## 已测试模型"

msgid "Batch invariance has been tested and verified on the following models:"
msgstr "批次不变性已在以下模型上进行了测试和验证："

msgid ""
"- **Qwen3 (Dense)**: `Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B`, `Qwen/Qwen3-8B`\n"
"- **Qwen3 (MoE)**: `Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B`, `Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B`"
msgstr ""
"- **Qwen3 (密集模型)**：`Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B`、`Qwen/Qwen3-8B`\n"
"- **Qwen3 (MoE)**：`Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B`、`Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B`"

msgid ""
"Other models may also work, but these have been explicitly validated. If you"
" encounter issues with a specific model, please report them on the [GitHub "
"issue tracker](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/new/choose)."
msgstr ""
"其他模型也可能适用，但这些模型已明确验证。如果您在特定模型上遇到问题，请在 [GitHub "
"问题跟踪器](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/new/choose) 上报告。"

msgid "## Implementation Details"
msgstr "## 实现细节"

msgid "When batch invariance is enabled, vLLM:"
msgstr "当启用批次不变性时，vLLM："

msgid ""
"1. Uses deterministic kernel implementations for attention and other operations\n"
"2. Ensures consistent numerical behavior across different batch sizes\n"
"3. Disables certain optimizations that may introduce non-determinism"
msgstr ""
"1. 对注意力和其他操作使用确定性内核实现\n"
"2. 确保不同批次大小下数值行为一致\n"
"3. 禁用可能引入非确定性的某些优化"

msgid ""
"Enabling batch invariance may impact performance compared to the default "
"non-deterministic mode. This trade-off is intentional to guarantee "
"reproducibility."
msgstr "与默认的非确定性模式相比，启用批次不变性可能会影响性能。这种权衡是故意的，以保证可复现性。"

msgid "## Future Improvements"
msgstr "## 未来改进"

msgid ""
"The batch invariance feature is under active development. Planned "
"improvements include:"
msgstr "批次不变性功能正在积极开发中。计划中的改进包括："

msgid ""
"For the latest status and to contribute ideas, see the [tracking "
"issue](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/5487)."
msgstr ""
"有关最新状态和贡献想法，请参见 [跟踪问题](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/5487)。"

msgid ""
"Batch invariance is currently in beta. Some features are still under active development.\n"
"    Track progress and planned improvements at [tracking issue #5487](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/5487)"
msgstr ""
"批量不变性目前处于测试阶段。部分功能仍在积极开发中。\n"
"    请通过[跟踪问题 #5487](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/5487)了解进展和计划改进。"

msgid ""
"The batch invariance attention operators currently do not support\n"
"    `FULL`,`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` cudagraph mode."
msgstr ""
"批量不变性注意力算子目前不支持\n"
"    `FULL`,`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` cudagraph模式。"

msgid ""
"- Support for additional NPUs series\n"
"- Support `FULL`,`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` cudagraph mode with batch invariance attention operators\n"
"- Expanded model coverage\n"
"- Performance optimizations\n"
"- Additional testing and validation"
msgstr ""
"- 支持更多NPU系列\n"
"- 支持批量不变性注意力算子的`FULL`,`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` cudagraph模式\n"
"- 扩展模型覆盖范围\n"
"- 性能优化\n"
"- 额外的测试和验证"

msgid ""
"To install the batch invariance custom operator library, set `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1` before building vllm-ascend.\n"
"    For installation instructions, see [installing in an existing CANN environment](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-existing-cann-install)."
msgstr ""
"要安装批量不变性自定义算子库，请在构建 vllm-ascend 之前设置 `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1`。\n"
"    有关安装说明，请参阅[在现有 CANN 环境中安装](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-existing-cann-install)。"

msgid ""
"Batch invariance requires custom operators for Atlas A2 and A3 inference "
"products. Set `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1` before building vllm-ascend from "
"source to build and install the required operator packages."
msgstr ""
"批量不变性需要针对 Atlas A2 和 A3 推理产品的自定义算子。在从源码构建 vllm-ascend 之前设置 "
"`VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1`，以构建并安装所需的算子包。"

msgid ""
"The `batch_invariant_ops` build and installation process consists of two "
"stages as in the [build_batch_invariant_ops.sh](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/csrc/build_batch_invariant_ops.sh), which must"
" run in order:"
msgstr ""
"`batch_invariant_ops` 的构建和安装过程包含两个阶段，如 "
"[build_batch_invariant_ops.sh](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/csrc/build_batch_invariant_ops.sh) 所示，必须按顺序执行："

msgid ""
"1. Install the operator run package. It provides the device-side batch-invariant operators implemented with AscendC.\n"
"2. Build and install the `batch_invariant_ops` wheel. It provides the PyTorch extension interfaces that invoke the AscendC operators."
msgstr ""
"1. 安装算子运行包。它提供了使用 AscendC 实现的设备端批量不变性算子。\n"
"2. 构建并安装 `batch_invariant_ops` wheel。它提供了调用 AscendC 算子的 PyTorch 扩展接口。"

msgid ""
"A prebuilt vllm-ascend wheel does not include the `csrc` directory or "
"`csrc/build_batch_invariant_ops.sh`, and setting `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1` "
"while installing that wheel does not rebuild the operators. Manual operator "
"installation requires a matching vllm-ascend source checkout. `<vllm-ascend-"
"source-dir>` in the following commands refers to that checkout, not the "
"wheel's `site-packages` directory."
msgstr ""
"预构建的 vllm-ascend wheel 不包含 `csrc` 目录或 "
"`csrc/build_batch_invariant_ops.sh`，在安装该 wheel 时设置 `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1` "
"不会重新构建算子。手动安装算子需要匹配的 vllm-ascend 源码检出。以下命令中的 `<vllm-ascend-source-dir>` "
"指的是该检出目录，而不是 wheel 的 `site-packages` 目录。"

msgid "### Install from source"
msgstr "### 从源码安装"

msgid "#### Option 1: Install vllm-ascend and the operator packages together"
msgstr "#### 选项 1：同时安装 vllm-ascend 和算子包"

msgid ""
"The environment variable is consumed by the source build. It works with both"
" a regular source installation and an editable source installation when "
"custom kernel compilation is enabled:"
msgstr "该环境变量由源码构建过程使用。在启用自定义内核编译时，它既适用于常规源码安装，也适用于可编辑源码安装："

msgid ""
"#### Option 2: Install the operator packages if vllm-ascend is already "
"installed"
msgstr "#### 选项 2：如果 vllm-ascend 已安装，则安装算子包"

msgid ""
"Obtain a vllm-ascend source tree that matches the installed package version,"
" then build and install the operator packages from that source tree."
msgstr "获取与已安装包版本匹配的 vllm-ascend 源码树，然后从该源码树构建并安装算子包。"

msgid "**A2:**"
msgstr "**A2：**"

msgid "**A3:**"
msgstr "**A3：**"

msgid "### Use Docker images"
msgstr "### 使用 Docker 镜像"

msgid ""
"The A2 and A3 Docker images build vllm-ascend from source with "
"`VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1`, so the image build installs both the AscendC "
"operator run package and the `batch_invariant_ops` wheel. This build-time "
"environment variable is not retained as a runtime setting. Set "
"`VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1` when starting the server or running offline "
"inference to enable batch invariance."
msgstr ""
"A2 和 A3 Docker 镜像在构建 vllm-ascend 时使用 `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1`，因此镜像构建会同时安装 "
"AscendC 算子运行包和 `batch_invariant_ops` "
"wheel。此构建时的环境变量不会保留为运行时设置。在启动服务器或运行离线推理时设置 `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1` "
"以启用批量不变性。"

msgid "### Quick Check"
msgstr "### 快速检查"

msgid "After installation, verify the ops are available:"
msgstr "安装后，验证算子是否可用："
